__pycache__/
src/
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.lst
*.map
build/

# The Calypsi toolchain, unpacked here so it lives with the repo that needs it
# rather than in a temp directory that gets cleaned up. NOT committed: it is
# closed source and redistribution is not permitted -- see
# X816_core/doc/TOOLCHAIN.md §1. Install it yourself from
# https://github.com/hth313/Calypsi-tool-chains/releases
Calypsi/
# Bisect binary, rebuilt on demand from the commit named in its filename.
programs/shell/shell_safe.bin
programs/shell/SAFE.*

# kalk's linker output. build.sh copies each .raw to the .bin that ships, and
# the two are byte-identical -- carrying both would double the size for no
# information. programs/shell/ tracks its .raw files for historical reasons;
# this directory starts clean rather than inheriting that.
programs/kalk/*.raw
